  "I1" [label="(0,0,0) Deduction: If OSCs are promising but have performance gaps, then improving their efficiency is a critical research goal"];
  "I3" [label="(0,0,0) Abduction: Asymmetric structures may reduce energy loss through modulation of molecular properties"];
  "I5" [label="(0,0,0) Abduction: Manipulating intermolecular interactions is a viable strategy for addressing the challenge of synergistic improvement"];
  "N1" [label="(1,0,0) OSCs have distinct merits (lightness, flexibility, etc.) and are promising green energy technology"];
  "N10" [label="(9,0,0) Synergistically improving luminescence and morphology is key but challenging"];
  "N11" [label="(10,0,0) Manipulating intermolecular interactions to control coupling properties suppresses E_loss and improves FF"];
